{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battlecaster is a top-down arena roguelike, fighting against challenging waves of enemies. Each enemy is lethal and can end your run quickly. Learn fast and think on your feet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 year anniversary - Re-release coming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In anticipation for the 3 year anniversary of Battlecaster, the game has received a major overhaul, with a brand new weapon system, inventory overhaul, and addition of a campaign map.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchases will be re-enabled after a period of testing and addressing player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/1.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic use of your powerful abilities to control the field and survive. After each round you'll have your pick from a handful of rewards to gain power, maximize your build and stats to be most effective in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/2.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike Arena Rush\u00a0</strong>\u2013 You've found yourself in the heart of the storm. Defend yourself in an abyssal arena or die trying.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced action</strong><i>\u00a0</i>\u2013\u00a0Display combat prowess and moment to moment decision making or face certain doom. You will be challenged by relentless enemies who will not give you an inch of breathing room.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Develop an arsenal<i>\u00a0</i></strong>\u2013\u00a0Collect powerful items and upgrades along the way to gain your advantage.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/3.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Roguelike gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every run is different and small decisions will have large impacts on your success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 enemies</strong> \u2013 Each acting filling a unique 'chess piece' role in the ring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>50+ items</strong> \u2013 Arm yourself with the equipment of heroes fallen before you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless waves</strong> \u2013 Increasingly difficult challenges to survive through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A true challenge. </strong> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720210?t=1746871199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720210?t=1746871199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/f8692074afcae7d5c996bd7967ac5373246cf220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746871199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/f8692074afcae7d5c996bd7967ac5373246cf220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746871199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battlecaster is a top-down arena roguelike, fighting against challenging waves of enemies. Each enemy is lethal and can end your run quickly. Learn fast and think on your feet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">3 year anniversary - Re-release coming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In anticipation for the 3 year anniversary of Battlecaster, the game has received a major overhaul, with a brand new weapon system, inventory overhaul, and addition of a campaign map.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchases will be re-enabled after a period of testing and addressing player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/1.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make strategic use of your powerful abilities to control the field and survive. After each round you'll have your pick from a handful of rewards to gain power, maximize your build and stats to be most effective in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/2.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelike Arena Rush\u00a0</strong>\u2013 You've found yourself in the heart of the storm. Defend yourself in an abyssal arena or die trying.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced action</strong><i>\u00a0</i>\u2013\u00a0Display combat prowess and moment to moment decision making or face certain doom. You will be challenged by relentless enemies who will not give you an inch of breathing room.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Develop an arsenal<i>\u00a0</i></strong>\u2013\u00a0Collect powerful items and upgrades along the way to gain your advantage.   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/extras/3.gif?t=1746871199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Roguelike gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every run is different and small decisions will have large impacts on your success. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 enemies</strong> \u2013 Each acting filling a unique 'chess piece' role in the ring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>50+ items</strong> \u2013 Arm yourself with the equipment of heroes fallen before you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless waves</strong> \u2013 Increasingly difficult challenges to survive through.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A true challenge. </strong> </p></li></ul>","developers":["Voltigeur"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1355770","name":"BATTLECASTER"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720210/cbc28b5491dda9337db35194d58d5ff9cf87d3ed/header.jpg?t=1746871199","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137642,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137642/movie480.mp4?t=1746869105","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137642/movie_max.mp4?t=1746869105"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137642/b07395ba430b6ca42446646dcd1627ce3abfbd64/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746869105","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137642/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746869105","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137642/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746869105"}}],"name":"BATTLECASTER Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</stron